; M3.8. The injection point selector is an OptionButton, and an OptionButton's
; drop-down is a PopupMenu — which was the last control in the game still
; rendering in default engine grey, because nothing had ever styled one. Same
; slab, same hairline accent border, same square corners as everything else.
